WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:03.235
- [Narrator] Since the beginning of time

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.920
(loud explosive burst)

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:05.850
The Wu Warlords

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.315
have brought suffering
and death to our world.

00:00:08.315 --> 00:00:09.770
(man screams)

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:12.200
But 1,000 monks sacrificed themselves

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.740
to empower a chosen one to stop them.

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:19.560
- I've been looking for your, Kai.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.780
You have the power of the monks.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.627
Your strength flows through you.

00:00:23.627 --> 00:00:26.303
The faces we protected.

00:00:26.303 --> 00:00:27.928
- What's this got to do with me?

00:00:27.928 --> 00:00:28.910
- [Female Character] You're
here because San Francisco

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:31.683
is where the path of the
Wu Warlords converge.

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.010
- I'm just a chef.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:34.870
- No, Kai.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:37.790
You are the Wu Assassin.

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:39.740
- The Wu Assassin bears a threat to me.

00:00:41.469 --> 00:00:44.060
Which means he's a threat
to you and to Chinatown.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.543
Find the Wu Assassin.

00:00:48.057 --> 00:00:49.880
(combat)

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.980
- You can't just kill
the head of the triad.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.610
He's your father.

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:56.316
- I have to triumph.

00:00:56.316 --> 00:00:57.290
- [Female Character] We have to help Kai.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.480
- Save the world.

00:00:58.480 --> 00:00:59.820
- Whatever happens, I got your back.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:00.875
We're family.

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:01.900
♪ Higher Brothers, Dogg Proud ♪

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.604
♪ We up in Chinatown ♪

00:01:03.604 --> 00:01:04.500
- Chop, chop.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.670
- You heard the woman.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:06.503
Chop, chop.

00:01:07.563 --> 00:01:09.856
♪ Who you gonna call?
Took his last breath ♪

00:01:09.856 --> 00:01:11.938
♪ Thrilla in Manila, I'm
a killer and a chef ♪

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:16.938
♪ Chinatown ♪

00:01:17.633 --> 00:01:19.817
♪ Clash him with a passion ♪

00:01:19.817 --> 00:01:21.650
♪ Top-Notch assassin ♪

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:23.790
- [Male Character] I'm willing
to do whatever's necessary

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:25.383
to protect my pow-wow.

00:01:25.383 --> 00:01:28.580
Even if I have to kill my own beloved son.

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:29.413
- You ready?

00:01:29.413 --> 00:01:30.246
- Are you?

00:01:34.742 --> 00:01:37.409
(intense music)

00:01:44.423 --> 00:01:45.540
- Who are you?

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:46.373
- I'm a chef.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.610
- I've seen this Wu Assassin.

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:55.730
It ain't him.

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:56.980
It's some old, bald dude.

00:01:59.113 --> 00:02:00.500
Whoa, okay.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:01.333
Stop doing that.

